        "out_raster.title": "Output Raster",
        "temporal_aggregation.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the temporal aggregation of the output multidimensional raster. The interpolation algorithm uses all available data within these time periods to calculate the output slice.</p><ul><li><span title=\"DAILY\">Daily</span>—The data values will be aggregated into daily time steps. This is the default.</li><li><span title=\"WEEKLY\">Weekly</span>—The data values will be aggregated into weekly time steps.</li><li><span title=\"MONTHLY\">Monthly</span>—The data values will be aggregated into monthly time steps.</li><li><span title=\"QUARTERLY\">Quarterly</span>—The data values will be aggregated into quarterly time steps.</li><li><span title=\"YEARLY\">Yearly</span>—The data values will be aggregated into yearly time steps.</li></ul></xdoc>",
